what happens when going back to work  becomes a source of motivation after an  accident or illness  Stefano lost both forearms to a machine  in an accident at work after a  revolutionary double hand transplant  he's learning to use his new limbs  Parliament's calling for europe-wide  solutions to tackle long term sickness  absence and to provide greater support  for people to remain in or return to the  job market MEP proposals would include  helping to make workplaces more  adaptable to people with disabilities  and chronic conditions individual  reintegration programs with support from  counselors or social workers or  psychological support after a burnout or  stress-related illness  and older people who choose to remain in  the workforce rather than retire should  also benefit from support like  vocational training Parliament believes  this growing pool of potential employees  should be seen as an opportunity not  only for the physical and mental  well-being of individuals but for the  good of society in general  [Music]
 

